{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-110","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与截差无理线段","englishTitle":"If from a medial area there be subtracted a medial area incommensurable with the whole, the two remaining irrational straight lines arise, either a second apotome of a medial straight line or a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole.","book":10,"number":110,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.110","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.110/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":110,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-110@raw-7147c1c8d5fce432","contentId":"euclid-10-110","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7147c1c8d5fce4321c14e78ff6fb0b10b5fb236459d1a32b3adab5ec4ffda4f7","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-110.statement","euclid-10-110.proof.1","euclid-10-110.proof.2","euclid-10-110.proof.3","euclid-10-110.proof.4","euclid-10-110.proof.5","euclid-10-110.proof.6","euclid-10-110.proof.7","euclid-10-110.conclusion","euclid-10-110.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-110.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-110","revisionId":"euclid-10-110@raw-7147c1c8d5fce432","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d7ca8cf667138d39dba1f80dd443c3bd8676202466f85f5a46bd76dfa0efbdb6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If from a medial area there be subtracted a medial area incommensurable with the whole, the two remaining irrational straight lines arise, either a second apotome of a medial straight line or a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从中项无理线段个区域中减去中项无理线段个区域不可公度,则其余两个无理线段个区域出现,或者中项无理线段个区域中的第二个截差无理线段个区域,或者产生中项无理线段个区域中项无理线段个区域中的整条直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-110.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-110","revisionId":"euclid-10-110@raw-7147c1c8d5fce432","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75778d97f318ce3de110872a795381bad4d85d78393aa8f54dc70720761c47ee","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, as in the foregoing figures, let there be subtracted from the medial area BC the medial area BD incommensurable with the whole; I say that the side of EC is one of two irrational straight lines, either a second apotome of a medial straight line or a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如前所述,请从中项无理线段个区域BC中减去中项无理线段个区域BD 不可公度个区域的全部;我说,EC区域是两个无理线段个区域之一,或者中项无理线段个区域中的第二个截差无理线段个,或者直线,中项无理线段个区域中项无理线段个区域中项无理线段个区域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-110.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-110","revisionId":"euclid-10-110@raw-7147c1c8d5fce432","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e8687973d1fd06a8c02b8b1b180540825fd83a269aeb55d2cf9305a9ba26f6f","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since each of the rectangles BC, BD is medial, and BC is incommensurable with BD, it follows that each of the straight lines FH, FK will be rational and incommensurable in length with FG. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于矩形 BC、BD为中项无理线段、BC为不可公度、BD为BD,因此,FH、FK直线的每条长度为有理和不可公度,FG直线为有理和不可公度。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-110.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-110","revisionId":"euclid-10-110@raw-7147c1c8d5fce432","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8bea63ac69048a363eb72063ed2c180e7123f9cb912d9348b4e11b4753b16ca2","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11","euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BC is incommensurable with BD, that is, GH with GK, HF is also incommensurable with FK; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] therefore FH, FK are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore KH is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC是不可公度,BD,GH是GK,HF也是不可公度,FK,FH,FK是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,KH是截差无理线段。 [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11) [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-110.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-110","revisionId":"euclid-10-110@raw-7147c1c8d5fce432","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc4aa9206ec261e004b94f5dd40cd3a568f25762f4c3f4cd85ed3d2b740df314","citations":["euclid-10-def-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If then the square on FH is greater than the square on FK by the square on a straight line commensurable with FH, while neither of the straight lines FH, FK is commensurable in length with the rational straight line FG set out, KH is a third apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果FH线上的正方形比FK线上的正方形比可公度上正方形比FH线上可公度上正方形比有理线段,而FH线上任何一个线上都没有长度可公度比有理线段上可公度比正方形比FK大,则KH是第三个截差无理线段。（相关点与线段：FG） [[X. Deff. III. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-110.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-110","revisionId":"euclid-10-110@raw-7147c1c8d5fce432","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3f56cc090e1c91b0fbc4e2c9bd20f8673845ac16cdf4075df2f0092946a1e08","citations":["euclid-10-93"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But KL is rational, and the rectangle contained by a rational straight line and a third apotome is irrational, and the side of it is irrational, and is called a second apotome of a medial straight line; [[X. 93](/principles/euclid-10-93)] so that the side of LH, that is, of EC, is a second apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但KL是有理,矩形是由有理线段和第三截差无理线段组成的无理,其侧面是无理, 被称作中项无理线段的第二截差无理线段;LH的侧面,即EC,是中项无理线段的第二截差无理线段。 [[X. 93](/principles/euclid-10-93)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-110.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-110","revisionId":"euclid-10-110@raw-7147c1c8d5fce432","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0a7126bf7693d9695530e49e5a868acc5894a9dd117488b3f0e8af4344771b8b","citations":["euclid-10-def-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if the square on FH is greater than the square on FK by the square on a straight line incommensurable with FH, while neither of the straight lines HF, FK is commensurable in length with FG, KH is a sixth apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果FH的正方形比FK的正方形高,不可公度比FH线正方形大,FH线中,FK线中,没有一个线都比FG线长度可公度大,FG线比HF线高,KH线是第六截差无理线段号线。 [[X. Deff. III. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-110.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-110","revisionId":"euclid-10-110@raw-7147c1c8d5fce432","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61cb3d89a79a71faa58ebce26d01a57b637e063838749f4ad0ecb726cb4927a4","citations":["euclid-10-96"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the side of the rectangle contained by a rational straight line and a sixth apotome is a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole. [[X. 96](/principles/euclid-10-96)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但由有理线段和第六截差无理线段组成的矩形公路的一侧是一条直线,中项无理线段公路的面积为中项无理线段个整条。 [[X. 96](/principles/euclid-10-96)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-110.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-110","revisionId":"euclid-10-110@raw-7147c1c8d5fce432","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9f38898660540e446fe6b64df6f6fcc0a9a05ef7f9b3ad4828440d80fcdce4e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side of LH, that is, of EC, is a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,LH,即EC的一侧是一条直线,中项无理线段个区域中项无理线段个整块。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-110.source","contentId":"euclid-10-110","revisionId":"euclid-10-110@raw-7147c1c8d5fce432","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30621ab13494f6e7f23d03339b02136a73cd7fa8325fe6e3c7f38abeb830f49b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.110/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.110\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}]